LICENCE — NOT YET DECIDED
=========================

This project has no licence yet. It is an open decision, tracked as item 3 in
docs/DESIGN.md §11 and in docs/PLAN.md.

Context for the decision:

- The official DFloat11 implementation (https://github.com/LeanModels/DFloat11)
  is Apache-2.0. Replicating its file format and its codebook-construction
  algorithm is compatible with any permissive licence.
- If this project ever redistributes `decode.ptx` (or any other artefact taken
  from the official repository), that file's licence and attribution
  requirements must be respected and reproduced.

Until the decision is made and this file is replaced, no licence is granted.
